# API Generated Boundary

- `src/api` is generated by Orval and is read-only.
- Do not manually edit files under `src/api`.
- Do not introduce wrapper directories for API unless explicitly requested.

## Required patterns

- Use generated hooks/functions/models from `src/api`.
- Keep custom runtime behavior in mutator/provider configuration, not generated files.
- Module pages (for example under `src/modules/auth/pages/*`) should consume generated API directly.

## Prohibited patterns

- Manual edits in `src/api`.
- Moving generated files into other folders during regular refactors.
